# November 19, 2026: the silver country of the West Kootenay, British Columbia: Kaslo on Kootenay Lake, and over the
# divide the Slocan towns of Sandon, Three Forks and New Denver. Region drawn at random by tools/choose.py (bc); the
# ground (Kaslo and the Slocan) chosen inside it.
# Sources read in this session: the Canadian Register of Historic Places statements (historicplaces.ca, read with a short
